easingly faster and raising its damage radius. Mode implemented for Halloween 2021 featuring a night version of The Ellipse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553480/extras/fe6308e2c21c6585cc8a5a19232bca73.webp?t=1693053986\" width=620 height=43 /></span><br>The first Escape Room is now available to be enjoyed singleplayer and cooperatively! Players have 30 minutes to guess the data required to exit via collecting items and solving the riddles inside the room. Tick, tock.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553480/extras/d70c109550e99da245a63b2f474b72a7.webp?t=1693053986\" width=620 height=60 /></span><br>Plot, betray or defend yourself in the first location of the game: <strong>The Ellipse</strong>. An introvert original piece of architecture to escape from while trying to solve the 24 different riddles and minigames it features.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553480/extras/600c9868ba0513859e57fb8df7e6069d.avif?t=1693053986\" width=620 height=349 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553480/extras/335c75d82936f98ace17f4d0f2265673.webp?t=1693053986\" width=620 height=60 /></span><br>Deliasi Platform is now available as of October, 20th! Who would build a dwelling in the middle of the ocean? You will have to find out.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553480/extras/c2ab86064ac2ae94a46499be1d5f2eea.poster.avif?t=1693053986\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553480/extras/c2ab86064ac2ae94a4649